      "zh": "# 4权杖：完整塔罗牌义\n\n## 核心主题\n\nPassion, creativity, action — phase 4。\n\n## 正位含义\n\n当4权杖正位出现时，它预示着Passion, creativity, action — phase 4。这是完全拥抱这张牌能量的时刻。\n\n## 逆位含义\n\n当逆位时，4权杖暗示能量受阻或过度。你可能在抗拒自然流动，或者这张牌的能量以不健康的方式显现。\n\n## 感情解读\n\n在感情问题中，4权杖表示Passion, creativity, action — phase 4。留意这个主题如何在你的关系中展开。\n\n## 事业解读\n\n在工作和事业中，4权杖指向你职业生活中的Passion, creativity, action — phase 4。\n\n## 建议\n\n4权杖的启示：Passion, creativity, action — phase 4。相信过程，让这股能量引导你。\n\n## 超越塔罗\n\n塔罗给你当下的快照。你的出生星盘揭示塑造你人生每一个篇章的底层模式。\n\n[免费生成星盘 →](/natal)\n\n[解锁2026年运报告 · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zxccdv)",
      "en": "# 4 of Wands: Complete Tarot Meaning\n\n## Core Theme\n\nPassion, creativity, action — phase 4.\n\n## Upright Meaning\n\nWhen 4 of Wands appears upright, it signals passion, creativity, action — phase 4. This is a time to embrace the energy of this card fully.\n\n## Reversed Meaning\n\nWhen reversed, 4 of Wands suggests blocked or excessive energy. You may be resisting the natural flow, or the card's energy may be manifesting in an unhealthy way.\n\n## In Love Readings\n\nIn matters of the heart, 4 of Wands indicates passion, creativity, action — phase 4. Pay attention to how this theme plays out in your relationships.\n\n## In Career Readings\n\nFor work and career, 4 of Wands points to passion, creativity, action — phase 4 in your professional life.\n\n## Advice\n\nThe message of 4 of Wands: Passion, creativity, action — phase 4. Trust the process and allow this energy to guide you.\n\n## Go Beyond Tarot\n\nTarot gives you a snapshot of the moment. Your birth chart reveals the underlying patterns that shape every chapter of your life.\n\n[Generate your free natal chart →](/natal)\n\n[Unlock your 2026 Annual Report · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zxccdv)",
